ly the European Union  has made clear that the membership of  the single market effectively means  membership of the European Union people  have decided not to be members of the  European Union so our relationship with  the single market will be a different  one in future but that doesn't mean it  can't be a really good trade  relationship that will now enable  our firms to have free access to the  single market and continue to trade in  ways that they have done in the past

